# Code owners.
#
# One human works on this repo, so this file is NOT about routing reviews to
# the right team. It is about making a review REQUEST appear on the paths where
# a mistake is expensive, so that opening a PR that touches one of them is a
# visible act rather than a quiet one.
#
# Note what this file cannot do on its own: CODEOWNERS only blocks a merge when
# branch protection turns on "require review from Code Owners", and that setting
# needs an approver who is not the PR author. On a solo repo that is a lock with
# no key, so it is deliberately left off (see docs/CI-AND-BRANCH-PROTECTION.md).
# What remains is the request, the ownership record, and a file that already
# works the day a second maintainer exists.

* @kenyonexpress

